  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Prevention, Protection, and Restoration for victims and girls at risk of Trafficking In Persons, Forced Labor, and Sexual Abuse</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The New Life Center Foundation (NLCF) will prevent TIP by providing education and training to tribal persons most vulnerable throughout Thailand. Additionally, the NLCF will provide protection and restoration for tribal victims of TIP, forced labor, and sexual abuse. Prevention activities include education, life skills, and vocational training for girls most vulnerable to TIP within Thailand. Protection and restoration for victims includes the provision of safe shelter, medical and mental health services, interpretation assistance, formal and informal education, vocational training, therapeutic activities (e.g. art, baking, handicrafts and music) and return and reintegration assistance.</narrative>
  </description>
